    "detailed_description": "ExoSoul is an adventure in the not-too-distant future where it's hard to separate man from machine. In a battle to regain your humanity, you, a consciousness that now lives in a virtual world, must use a robotic body to escape your captivity and discover the truth about yourself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRECISION SHOOTER</h2>Weapons alone will not be enough. Use your skill to overcome challenges and destroy increasingly stronger enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/f271177d0d16c7950dc29e3989c45aed.poster.avif?t=1696444213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/f271177d0d16c7950dc29e3989c45aed.webm?t=1696444213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/f271177d0d16c7950dc29e3989c45aed.mp4?t=1696444213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >15+ UNIQUE WEAPONS</h2>In each run, you'll find a diverse selection of unique weapons that offer a variety of gameplay experiences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/2b63562b88eb8fa00c9f9dc63ef58991.poster.avif?t=1696444213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/2b63562b88eb8fa00c9f9dc63ef58991.webm?t=1696444213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/2b63562b88eb8fa00c9f9dc63ef58991.mp4?t=1696444213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 STAGES OF SYNCHRONY</h2>Keep your mind and body in sync to get bonuses and increase your chances of survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH IS NOT THE END</h2>Your body may be destroyed, but your mind lives on and is driven by the will to know the truth. With each run, you'll have access to a new combination of upgrades and power-ups.",
    "about_the_game": "ExoSoul is an adventure in the not-too-distant future where it's hard to separate man from machine. In a battle to regain your humanity, you, a consciousness that now lives in a virtual world, must use a robotic body to escape your captivity and discover the truth about yourself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRECISION SHOOTER</h2>Weapons alone will not be enough. Use your skill to overcome challenges and destroy increasingly stronger enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/f271177d0d16c7950dc29e3989c45aed.poster.avif?t=1696444213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/f271177d0d16c7950dc29e3989c45aed.webm?t=1696444213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/f271177d0d16c7950dc29e3989c45aed.mp4?t=1696444213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >15+ UNIQUE WEAPONS</h2>In each run, you'll find a diverse selection of unique weapons that offer a variety of gameplay experiences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/2b63562b88eb8fa00c9f9dc63ef58991.poster.avif?t=1696444213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/2b63562b88eb8fa00c9f9dc63ef58991.webm?t=1696444213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410320/extras/2b63562b88eb8fa00c9f9dc63ef58991.mp4?t=1696444213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 STAGES OF SYNCHRONY</h2>Keep your mind and body in sync to get bonuses and increase your chances of survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH IS NOT THE END</h2>Your body may be destroyed, but your mind lives on and is driven by the will to know the truth. With each run, you'll have access to a new combination of upgrades and power-ups.",
